# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 1. Start: i21_start.sav (~/fe8-chapsaves; Ephraim's route, final chapter part 1, chapterIndex 34, game save in slot 1 at the chapter's start, real army). Restart Chapter, skip the opening talk, the preparations menu's Save into slot 2 (a game save, turn 0), Fight!, Ephraim waits in place (a suspend save), map menu Suspend, Yes (a suspend save).
# 6400 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu (opens on Restart Chapter)
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Restart Chapter: the slot list
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, slot 1 (Final Chapter: Sacred Stone)
000*1098
008*2      # 2800: Start, skip the opening talk: the preparations menu
000*298
040*2      # 3100: Up, wraps to Save
000*148
001*2      # 3250: A, Save: the save menu (cursor on slot 1)
000*198
080*2      # 3450: Down, slot 2 (NO DATA)
000*148
001*2      # 3600: A, slot 2 (Save / Cancel)
000*198
001*2      # 3800: A, Save: the game save in slot 2; back to the preparations menu
000*298
008*2      # 4100: Start, Fight!: turn 1's player phase
000*348
001*2      # 4450: A, select Ephraim under the cursor
000*148
001*2      # 4600: A, his own tile: the action menu (Item, Supply, Wait)
000*148
040*2      # 4750: Up, wraps to Wait
000*148
001*2      # 4900: A, Wait (a suspend save)
000*198
001*2      # 5100: A on grey Ephraim: the map menu
000*148
040*2      # 5250: Up, wraps to End
000*148
040*2      # 5400: Up, Suspend
000*148
001*2      # 5550: A, Suspend: 'Do you want to quit?'
000*248
001*2      # 5800: A, Yes (a suspend save)
000*598
